 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted in the unlabelled first section: Mind What You Have Learned / Save You It Can, Dagobah, Heading For The Medical Frigate, The Way Of Things, Wise Advice, Draw Their Fire; they count toward the 60. Three Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
